/-!
# Repaired-root spin--torsion acceptance bridge

The fixed S9-C acceptance predicate reads a dependency-light Cartan torsion
coordinate and the historical pure-matter Lorentz coefficient.  This module
proves that both are faithful coordinates of the same geometric torsion and
action-generated W13 matter functional used by the repaired root.

Consequently, repaired-root stationarity on the computed `II+` actual makes
nonzero same-actual spin leave nonzero torsion.  No contorsion solution,
inverse torsion map, nonzero witness, or acceptance receipt is supplied.
-/

